---
import ArrowDiagonal from '../../assets/icons/arrow-diagonal.svg'
import aliadoPhoto from '../../assets/home/aliado-1.jpg'
---

<section class="flex items-center justify-center bg-[#fafafa] py-16">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-[1216px] items-center justify-center gap-[136px] px-[104px]">
    <div class="relative flex h-[432px] w-[384px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
      <div
        class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 size-[300px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-[24px] border-[#ed8419]"
      >
      </div>
      <div class="relative h-[380px] w-[235px] overflow-hidden rounded-[120px]">
        <img src={aliadoPhoto.src} alt="" class="size-full object-cover" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#ef7800]/20 mix-blend-soft-light"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
        <p class="max-w-[492px] font-sans text-5xl leading-[1.3] tracking-[-1px] text-black">
          Sabias que podés convertirte en un aliado de Sol Internet?
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-base tracking-[-0.32px] text-[#181818]">
          Indica nuestros planes de internet a tus amigos y cliente y ganá comisiones por ventas.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/indicacion-de-amigos"
        class="font-franklin-medium flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[35px] bg-[#25d366] px-8 py-4 text-base tracking-[-0.32px] text-[#181818]"
      >
        Saber más
        <img src={ArrowDiagonal.src} alt="" class="size-6" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
